---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms">
  <article class="legal">
    <h1>Terms</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated 4 November 2026</p>

    <p>
      Muster is a free hobby project for planning game nights with friends. By using the website, the Discord app or the
      addon, you agree to these short terms.
    </p>

    <h2>Use it kindly</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Use Muster to plan play time with people who want to plan with you.</li>
      <li>Don't use it to spam, harass or mention people who didn't ask for it.</li>
      <li>Don't try to see other groups' plans, break the service or overload it.</li>
      <li>Follow Discord's terms when you use the Discord app.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>No guarantees</h2>
    <p>
      Muster is provided as it is, without warranties. It may be down, lose data, change or stop. Don't rely on it for
      anything important. Times are shown in your time zone as best we can, but check before a raid.
    </p>

    <h2>Your content</h2>
    <p>
      Your plans and characters are yours. You let Muster store them and show them to the groups you share with, as
      described in the <a href="/privacy">privacy page</a>. Delete them any time from{" "}
      <a href="/app/account">your account</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Not affiliated with Blizzard or Discord</h2>
    <p>
      World of Warcraft is a trademark of Blizzard Entertainment. Discord is a trademark of Discord Inc. Muster isn't made,
      endorsed or supported by either.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>
      These terms can change as Muster does. The date at the top says when. The code is open source under the{" "}
      <a href="https://github.com/Ringpro/wow-forever-party-planner/blob/main/LICENSE">MIT license</a>.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal h1 {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .legal h2 {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin: 28px 0 8px;
  }
  .legal p,
  .legal li {
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .legal ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
  }
</style>
